---
import ProfileLayout from '../layouts/ProfileLayout.astro';
---

<ProfileLayout title="Teaching">
  <article class="profile-page">
    <header class="profile-page-header">
      <h1>Teaching</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="profile-teaching-section" aria-labelledby="teaching-assistant-heading">
      <h2 id="teaching-assistant-heading">&lt;Teaching assistant&gt;</h2>
      <ul class="profile-teaching-list">
        <li>
          2026 Fall
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="profile-keep-together">Problem Solving (문제해결기법)</span>
              <span class="profile-keep-together">Head T.A. (lecturer) at KAIST</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="profile-keep-together">Formal Languages and Automata</span>
              <span class="profile-keep-together">(형식언어 및 오토마타)</span>
              <span class="profile-keep-together">T.A. at KAIST</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          2025 Fall
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="profile-keep-together">Problem Solving (문제해결기법)</span>
              <span class="profile-keep-together">T.A. at KAIST</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-teaching-section lecture-materials" aria-labelledby="lecture-materials-heading">
      <h2 id="lecture-materials-heading">&lt;Lecture materials&gt;</h2>
      <p>Slides for CS.20002 Problem Solving at KAIST, Fall 2026. Materials are in Korean.</p>
      <ul class="profile-teaching-list">
        <li>
          <a href="/teaching/2026-fall-cs20002/week-1-lecture-slides.pdf" lang="ko">0주차 — 오리엔테이션, 문제 해결의 기초 도구</a>
          <span class="profile-keep-together">(2026-09-04 · PDF)</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/teaching/2026-fall-cs20002/week-2-lecture-slides.pdf" lang="ko">1주차 — 동적 계획법, HW0 풀이</a>
          <span class="profile-keep-together">(2026-09-11 · PDF)</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="materials-note">The public orientation slides omit contact details and group enrollment instructions. Original slide numbering is preserved. Course announcements reflect the lecture date.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</ProfileLayout>

<style>
  .lecture-materials { margin-top: 40px; }
  .lecture-materials p { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 15px; }
  .lecture-materials a { color: var(--profile-accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .lecture-materials a:focus-visible { outline: 1px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .lecture-materials li + li { margin-top: 8px; }
  .lecture-materials .materials-note { margin-top: 14px; color: var(--profile-muted); font-size: 13px; }
</style>
